# SfxLab family v2: layer id name type dur seed key=value... (dur 0 = endless) · range id param lo hi [note] · bind signal id|* param [lo hi] [rel] [steps=N | scale=<chord>] · note text · then `spell <id>` sections: name, recipe, the spell's layers at their lock values, its binds and notes
bench 1
root 65.4064
# cryic: water with time stopped. The frost pads carry the bed and the notes, the aqueous recordings come back frozen (the droplets
# stand still as the ratios come in tune, the rumble is the lake under the ice), a continuous ice crackle follows the pen.
