range bed level 0.42 0.6 the frost pad as it was made (frost_synth_base, B4 +31c nudged 0.69 st up to C5; drive 0.1 lifts its body): steps back with stir and as the machine fills
range bed shimmer 0 0.5 cloudy ice at coherence 0, clear at 1
range bed ph_pos 0 1 the phaser notch, parked by the orb's curl (mix fixed at 0.6)
range deep level 0 0.3 the lake under the ice: the aqueous rumble at C2, all but frozen (0.15x), grows with the machine. The only bass.
range root level 0 0.7 C4: frost_synth_base2 (A#4 +10c, an octave down) as sines only
range third level 0 0.6 E4
range fifth level 0 0.6 G4
range seventh level 0 0.5 Bb4
range glass level 0 0.7 the aqueous stream's droplets an octave up, bell-stretched hard (0.15) with the inharmonics pushed up: glass, not water; gathered onto the chord
range glass speed 0.02 0.25 never liquid: slow ice at coherence 0, frozen solid at 1
range creak level 0 0.5 crunching ice as a choir: eight read heads scattered over the recording at one pitch, so the sparse cracks become a continuous crackle: the pen's speed
range wind level 0 0.18 the stream high-passed and slowed to 0.3x: a cold hiss, in with stir
range cloud level 0 0.18 the chord at C5 in sines, growing with the machine; spells raise it and pick the chord
range cloud voices 4 8
range cloud gather 0.6 1
bind stir bed level 0.6 0.42
bind stack bed level 0 -0.1 rel
bind orb.radius bed cutoff 0.45 0.9
bind orb.curl bed ph_pos 0 1
bind coherence bed shimmer 0.5 0
bind stack deep level 0 0.3
bind tone.root root level 0 0.7
bind tone.third third level 0 0.6
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.6
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.5
bind fit root shimmer 0.4 0
bind fit third shimmer 0.4 0
bind fit fifth shimmer 0.4 0
bind fit seventh shimmer 0.4 0
bind orb.radius root cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.radius third cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.radius fifth cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.radius seventh cutoff 0.5 1
bind stack glass level 0 0.7
bind coherence glass speed 0.25 0.02
bind radiance glass reverb 0.6 0.95
bind orb.speed creak level 0 0.5
bind orb.speed creak speed 0.5 1.4
bind orb.accel creak drive 0.12 0.3
bind orb.radius creak cutoff 0.6 1
bind stir wind level 0 0.18
bind orb.radius wind cutoff 0.65 0.85
bind stack cloud level 0 0.18
bind coherence cloud gather 0.6 1
bind stack cloud voices 4 8
note cryic v1 (draft, 2026-10-02). Water with time stopped: the family an aqueous crystal turns into. Inverse of aqueous's register: everything is
note high and glassy (chord tones C4-Bb4, bed and pad C5), one bass layer (the aqueous rumble, nearly frozen, growing with stack).
note The four jobs: alive = the frost pad (bed); notes = frost_synth_base2's partials at the chord tones (tone.*), steadied by fit;
note in tune = the FREEZE: the glassy droplets stop (glass speed 0.25 -> 0.02 with coherence) and the bed's shimmer clears;
note orb = a continuous ice crackle (level and rate) with the pen's speed, filters with its radius, the bed's phaser notch with its curl.
note One-shots: freezing splash on lock, a glass tink on accept (the drip's partials alone at C6, bell-stretched), the swish-whip crack on unlock.
note The frost pad's pitch estimate is the analyser's (A#4 +10c; bed +1.9 st = C5, voices an octave under); it is chordal, so check the voices by ear (R re-tunes).
note Spells below are placeholders (names, recipes borrowed from other families' shapes): they exist so the score and the lock have something to find.

